  "reflectionText": "Jesus looked at the young man and loved him, and said: go, sell, give, follow me. The young man went away sorrowful, because he had great possessions. What is the hurt of being loved by Jesus and still walking away, because the one thing asked is the one thing you have not yet learned to lose?"
